Title: Lags

/* The mechanics of the committed story's first scenes (a default fade, a CUT, two AUTO-ANIMATEs; focus, next and
   sfx Cues) with short narration, so that the capture stays small. */

# One

INT. TITLE CARD - DAY

Same name, new place {#title @mc .title}
A small idea {#sub @bc .muted}

NARRATOR
Here is a title.

INT. FIRST SCREEN - DAY

First screen {#tag @tl .label}
A box {#box @ml .box}
Another box {#twin @mr .box hidden}

NARRATOR
Picture a box. [[focus: box]] Then another. [[next]] Done.

# Two

> CUT

INT. THE NAMES - DAY

Box one {#one @ml .box}
Box two {#two @mr .box}
Every box has a name {#tag @tc .label}

NARRATOR
Give every box a name. [[focus: tag]] Fine.

> AUTO-ANIMATE

INT. THE NEXT SCREEN - DAY

Box one {#one @mc .box}
Every box has a name {#tag @tc .accent}
Same name, so it moves {#hint @bc .muted}

NARRATOR
Box one moves. [[sfx: whoosh]] There.

> AUTO-ANIMATE

INT. A NEW NAME - DAY

Box one {#one @mr .box}
Same name, so it moves {#hint @bc .accent}
Box three {#three @ml .box}

NARRATOR
A new box appears. [[sfx: ding]]
